# Raw crawl caches are rebuildable from the network, so most stay out.
# Committed on purpose: cache/setlists/ (plain-text setlist facts; the CMU
# origin is unmaintained) and cache/digests/ (the review-digest source of
# truth — regenerating them needs an OpenAI key, which nobody else should
# need). cache/jgimages/ pages are verbatim copies of another site and stay
# out; `make images` refetches them. Only the two derived, URL-only indexes
# stage 4 needs are kept.
cache/search/
cache/metadata/
cache/tracks/
cache/jgimages/*
!cache/jgimages/gallery.json
!cache/jgimages/index.json
out/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
